# Storefront contract sync

The nopCommerce Headless API DTOs and Commerce provider types are one shared contract.

When changing product, collection, cart, page, menu, image, money, SEO, or availability fields:

- Update both sides of the contract.
- Backend source: `nopcommerce/src/Plugins/Nop.Plugin.Misc.HeadlessApi/Models/Dtos.cs`.
- Frontend source: `commerce/lib/types.ts`.
- Update backend mapping code in `HeadlessApiModelFactory` when backend fields change.
- Update provider and UI code in `commerce/lib/nopcommerce` and dependent components when frontend fields change.
- Do not add optional frontend fallbacks for fields that the backend must always return.
- Run frontend typecheck and build after contract changes.
